Frozen field catalog
  pcap_lab/catalog/tshark-4.6.8.catalog.sqlite3.gz contains the field,
  protocol and value-string inventory reported by `tshark -G` from that same
  Wireshark 4.6.8 build. That inventory is derived from Wireshark's
  GPL-2.0-or-later dissector sources and is redistributed here for
  reproducibility of the measured baseline only.

Synthetic captures
  All packet captures used by the benchmark are generated by this project
  from documentation/example addresses. They contain no real traffic.

